ewing and dedicated trade client portals.","keyMetrics":[{"label":"Organic Search Revenue","value":"+210%","sub":"High-intent interior design queries"},{"label":"Repeat B2B Trade Orders","value":"+74%","sub":"Architect & contractor account portal"},{"label":"SKU Combinations","value":"55,000+","sub":"Managed with sub-second filter speed"},{"label":"Mobile Bounce Rate","value":"-38%","sub":"Fast visual gallery exploration"}],"challenge":"Architectural hardware has endless complexity: each handle comes in 6+ finishes (Satin Brass, Antique Bronze, Matte Black, Polished Chrome) and requires matching hinges, latches, and escutcheons. Customers were confused by disorganized options, and trade professionals lacked an easy way to specify whole-house schedules.","solution":"We built an intuitive, visual-first shopping experience. Users can toggle finishes across entire hardware collections simultaneously. We created a 'Project Hardware Scheduler' allowing architects to group selections by room, download PDF specifications for clients, and receive automatic trade volume discounts.","deliverables":["Custom Architectural eCommerce Platform","Dynamic Multi-Variant Finish Visualizer","Architect & Interior Designer Trade Portal","Room-by-Room Hardware Schedule Generator","Technical Product Schema & Fast UK Shipping Logic"],"testimonial":{"quote":"Specifying ironmongery used to be a headache for our architect clients. The new platform makes pairing finishes effortless. Our trade accounts have surged, and online revenue has more than doubled.","author":"James Thornton","role":"Commercial Director, Designer Handle UK"},"snapshotPreview":{"header":"Architectural Door Handles & Luxury Interior Ironmongery","searchPlaceholder":"Search by Finish (Satin Brass, Matte Black, Antique Bronze)...","highlights":["Solid Brass & Marine Grade 316 Stainless Steel","Trade Discount Accounts for Architects & Builders","Next-Day Dispatch Across the UK"],"featuredCategories":["Interior Door Handles","Cabinet Knobs & Pulls","Matching Locks & Hinges","Architectural Window Fittings"]}},"mode":"card"}]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.8rem","fontWeight":700,"color":"#2563EB","textTransform":"uppercase","marginBottom":"0.4rem"},"children":"Interior Architecture & Trade eCommerce"}],["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.4rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":"0.65rem"},"children":["Designer Handle UK"," — ","Designerhandle.co.uk"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.95rem","color":"var(--text-secondary)","lineHeight":1.6,"marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":"Designer Handle supplies luxury door handles, cabinet hardware, and architectural ironmongery to UK architects, interior designers, and discerning homeowners. We developed a sophisticated catalog with live finish previewing and dedicated trade client portals."}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/work/designer-handle/","className":"btn-black-pill","style":{"fontSize":"0.88rem","padding":"0.6rem 1.4rem"},"children":"Read Case Study →"}]]}],["$","div","sofinfra",{"className":"approach-card home-service-card","style":{"padding":"2rem"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":["$","$L5",null,{"caseStudy":{"id":"sofinfra","slug":"sofinfra","client":"Sofinfra Realty Advisory","url":"https://sofinfra.com","domain":"Sofinfra.com","title":"Luxury Real Estate & Commercial Advisory Portal Capturing High-Net-Worth Investors","subtitle":"High-ticket property acquisition platform with yield calculators and confidential listing showcases.","industry":"Luxury Real Estate & Advisory","category":"realestate","region":"Delhi NCR, Gurugram & Noida, India","themeColor":"#09090B","accentColor":"#10B981","heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","screenshotImage":"/images/case-studies/sofinfra-screenshot.png","iconImage":"/images/case-studies/icons/sofinfra-icon.svg","summary":"Sofinfra is an elite real estate advisory firm serving High-Net-Worth Individuals (HNWIs) and corporate investors seeking prime residential and commercial assets across Delhi NCR (Golf Course Road, Cyber City, Southern Peripheral). We designed a private-client advisory portal that exudes exclusivity and builds immediate trust.","keyMetrics":[{"label":"Transaction Value Influenced","value":"$$28M+","sub":"In luxury residential & office assets"},{"label":"Qualified HNWI Leads","value":"68%","sub":"High-intent inquiry rate"},{"label":"Private Consultations","value":"4.2x","sub":"Growth in booked advisory sessions"},{"label":"Media Load Time","value":"0.9s","sub":"4K architectural asset streaming"}],"challenge":"High-value property investors are deterred by spammy listing portals with fake prices. Sofinfra needed a sophisticated digital presence that reflects discretion, institutional advisory caliber, and verified property market intelligence to attract Ultra-HNWIs and corporate occupiers.","solution":"We engineered a clean, minimalist platform reminiscent of Swiss private banking. Each luxury development features curated video tours, neighborhood infrastructure analytics, projected rental yields, and confidential inquiry gates. We integrated direct scheduling with senior partners and automated lead enrichment via enterprise CRM.","deliverables":["Ultra-Luxury Real Estate Brand & Web Platform","Interactive Investment Yield & Capital Gain Calculators","Confidential Off-Market Property Vault","VIP Private Advisor Booking System","High-Security Enterprise CRM Integration"],"testimonial":{"quote":"Our clients expect the highest standard of sophistication. Accelerance delivered a digital presence that sets us apart from ordinary brokers. It establishes credibility before our advisors even step into a meeting.","author":"Abhishek S.","role":"Partner & Head of Private Wealth, Sofinfra"},"snapshotPreview":{"header":"Curated Luxury Estates & Commercial Portfolios in Delhi NCR","searchPlaceholder":"Explore Prime Locations: Golf Course Ext Road, Cyber City, Diplomatic Enclave...","highlights":["Verified Institutional & Luxury Assets Only","Comprehensive Due Diligence & Yield Analysis","Discreet Private Advisory for Family Offices"],"featuredCategories":["Luxury Penthouses & Villas","Grade-A Commercial Floors","Pre-Leased High-Yield Assets","Bespoke Land Parcels"]}},"mode":"card"}]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.8rem","fontWeight":700,"color":"#2563EB","textTransform":"uppercase","marginBottom":"0.4rem"},"children":"Luxury Real Estate & Advisory"}],["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.4rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":"0.65rem"},"children":["Sofinfra Realty Advisory"," — ","Sofinfra.com"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.95rem","color":"var(--text-secondary)","lineHeight":1.6,"marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":"Sofinfra is an elite real estate advisory firm serving High-Net-Worth Individuals (HNWIs) and corporate investors seeking prime residential and commercial assets across Delhi NCR (Golf Course Road, Cyber City, Southern Peripheral). We designed a private-client advisory portal that exudes exclusivity and builds immediate trust."}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/work/sofinfra/","className":"btn-black-pill","style":{"fontSize":"0.88rem","padding":"0.6rem 1.4rem"},"children":"Read Case Study →"}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"faq-compact-section","style":{"background":"var(--bg-secondary)","borderTop":"1px solid var(--border-light)"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"textAlign":"center","maxWidth":700,"margin":"0 auto"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-label","children":"Clear Answers"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title","children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-container-list","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"faq-item-card","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"faq-q-title","children":"What files and deliverables do we receive at th